diagnostics/enum-data-keys.em:5:18: a set cannot hold Bag
      const later: Set[Bag]
                   ^^^^^^^^
A set holds whole or decimal numbers, `Bool`s, `String`s, enum values, or tuples of those. Anything that can change after it is stored could not be found again.
diagnostics/enum-data-keys.em:22:18: Chain cannot be a dictionary key, because `Chain.link.next` holds another Chain
